"5000-1" - Leicester City's 2015-16 Premier League title, an animated fan retelling for the Foot All FC channel. Comic History Cartoon style (lemo-opuscar).
Unofficial: not made or endorsed by Leicester City FC, Chelsea FC, Tottenham Hotspur, the Premier League or any broadcaster or bookmaker. No club crests,
league marks, broadcast footage or real likenesses are used; players are generic paper puppets identified by shirt number.

Puppet art: the Barcelona-style part sheets of videos/barca-remontada-short (ChatGPT image model in Figma, gpt-image-2.5-flare, AI-generated),
  recoloured into plain kits with tools/recolor_kit.py (Leicester-style plain blue 'lei', generic white opponents 'opp').
Narration: Microsoft VibeVoice-Realtime-0.5B, voice "Frank" (MIT licence), AI-generated voice.
Fonts (SIL Open Font License): IM FELL English SC (Igino Marini), Old Standard TT (Alexey Kryukov), Lilita One (Juan Montoreano).
Instruments (sampled, via lemo-opuscar core/audio/sampler.py): see out/instruments.txt at build time.
Samples (CC0): FreePats project (freepats.zenvoid.org), VS Chamber Orchestra: Community Edition (Versilian Studios), Versilian Community Sample Library (Versilian Studios)
Foley, crowd and ambience: synthesized in mix.py.
